# Line-ending policy lives in the repository, not on each machine:
# normalize on checkin (LF in the index — which is what it already holds),
# follow the platform on checkout. Without this file the checkin filter
# depended on the clone's core.autocrlf (true system-wide on this Windows
# box), so a "git touch" rewrote CRLF/LF in place — the phantom
# whole-file diffs behind issue #13 (vibecoder_issues_and_fixes.md).
* text=auto
